LOCATION:The Lilypad\, 1353 Cambridge St\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:$15 suggested / $5 with Student ID / 6:30pm start / seated The 
 jazz quintet Standard Deviation\, led by pianist and composer Bert Seager\
 , is a tight\, two-horn\, hard-bop combo that plays his arrangements of ja
 zz standards alongside his own singable originals. The music offers plenty
  of room for the band to open up and interact. Their special chemistry mak
 es it obvious why sharing jazz in an intimate club like the Lilypad remain
 s such a compelling communal experience.\nhttps://www.lilypadinman.com/hom
 e/2026/bert-seagers-standard-deviation-49b7p\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https:/
