SUMMARY:Molecular
LOCATION:The Lilypad\, 1353 Cambridge St\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:$10 at the door / 5pm doors / 5:30 show / seated & standing / a
 ll ages Free admission for the first 36 reservations at In the quiet isola
 tion of the laboratory\, amid the hum of vacuum pumps and the irritability
  of failed reactions\, I found stories hidden in the molecules. Molecular 
 is the culmination of those long nights: the frustration of broken bonds\,
  the sudden spark of an unexpected synthesis\, and the realization that th
 e atomic world mirrors the depth of our own emotions.\nhttps://www.lilypad
 inman.com/home/2026/12/12/molecular\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.
 city/
