SUMMARY:BENEDICT KOH BIG BAND + durianhead
LOCATION:The Lilypad\, 1353 Cambridge St\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:$15 admission / 4:30 doors / 5pm show / seated & standing duria
 nhead is a Boston-based Singaporean musician working with noise\, glitch\,
  ambient\, drone\, and experimental electronics. Using self-made digital i
 nstruments\, they explore the increasingly blurred lines between the acces
 sible and the avant-garde: a singular\, egalitarian third-stream voice wra
 ngling every last bit of sonic detritus into monolithic walls of sound\, c
 olor\, and light.\nhttps://www.lilypadinman.com/home/2026/12/13/benedict-k
 oh-big-band-durianhead\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
