  Ecstatic Music and Louis Andriessen's Workers Union\, this program lives 
 in the extremes of experience. Angélica Negrón's Dust is in the silent m
 oments following a disaster\, the dust settling\, despair and possibility 
 the possibility of growth simultaneously in the air\, Eli-Eri Moura's Cân
 ticos Meridionais is a tribute to Brazilian folk traditions\, and works by
  Cara Haxo and Arvo Pärt have a trance-like quality\, inviting is to slow
  down\, look closely. The opposite of the ecstatic.\nhttps://www.lilypadin
 man.com/home/2026/12/15/longys-ensemble-uncaged-presents-ecstatic\nFrom Pu
